==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Voltfruit}}
Voltfruits can be found growing from [[Cactus|Cacti]] within the [[Gerudo Desert]], and they can be be bought at [[Lorn's Fruit Stand]] in [[Gerudo Town]]. Red [[Hinox]]es can also drop Voltfruits upon their deaths. When eaten, Voltfruits provide [[Link]] with half a [[Heart]]. Voltfruits exposed to [[Fire]] become [[Roasted Voltfruit]]. [[Meal]]s made using Voltfruits give [[Link]] [[Shock Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> The [[Kochi Dye Shop]] accepts them as an ingredient for Orange [[Dye]].

A Voltfruit is needed in order to make [[Creamy Heart Soup]].
