==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Voltfruit}}
Voltfruits once again grow on [[Cactus|Cacti]] in the [[Gerudo Desert]].<ref name="TotK Inventory"/> They are naturally insulated and known for their sweet taste.<ref name="TotK Inventory"/> Voltfruits restore half of a [[Heart]] to [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]] when eaten. Due to being insulated, they cause [[Food]]s [[Cooking|Cooked]] with them to grant [[Link]] [[Shock Resistance]].<ref name="TotK Inventory"/> They can be used as an ingredient for [[Orange Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] in [[Hateno Village]]. Voltfruits exposed to [[Fire]]s or [[Scorching Climate]]s become [[Roasted Voltfruit]]s.

They have no special properties when [[Fuse]]d to [[Weapon]]s, [[Shield]]s or [[Arrow]]s.

A Voltfruit is needed in order to make [[Creamy Heart Soup]] or a [[Noble Pursuit]].
